      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy though. like every morning i wake up and i already know it's gonna be the same grayness. it's exhausting to pretend everything is okay when it actually feels like i'm just a ghost walking around in a life that isn't mine. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but i know nothing is gonna change. it’s just... constant.",
